                                                "sense_id": "83ec3dc8-c1f5-3ea2-af5b-4a4a9d4930e7",
                                                "text": "He had indeed been making a study of his dreams, to what purpose or effect is not apparent, but there remains a note-book filled with closely written observations upon them, for he seemed always to awaken with most vivid recollections of astounding, amusing, and bizarre somnial experiences."
                                            },
