                                                "sense_id": "83ec3dc8-c1f5-3ea2-af5b-4a4a9d4930e7",
                                                "text": "Often, it was Sara Hutchinson who was the focus of his somnial fantasy life: he once exclaimed that his dreams were \"always connected in some way or another\" with her (CN II 2055)."
